OL,3,GNEWSAChippy's expansion plan battered
OL,4,Aby nearby rival
OL,5,
OL,6,FA row has broken out in a picturesque
OL,7,Fseaside town between two fish and chip
OL,8,Fshops over plans made by one of them to
OL,9,Fexpand.
OL,11,FFor decades the quayside in
OL,12,FWells-next-the-Sea in Norfolk has been
OL,13,Fdominated by French's and Platten's `
OL,14,Fnear-neighbours separated by a former
OL,15,Farcade.
OL,17,FBut the latter has objected to plans by
OL,18,FFrench's to expand into the empty
OL,19,Fbuilding, arguing that would damage the
OL,20,F"diversity" of businesses in the area.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
